  "description": "Inspired by jQuery and Node.js, ZapLib is a lightweight C# library that helps developers accomplish complex tasks with minimal code — HTTP requests, SQL Server / Oracle queries, .NET Web API extensions, SMTP mail, regular expressions, and more.\n\n      📚 Documentation: https://linzap.github.io/ZapLib/\n      🔧 Source & Issues: https://github.com/LinZap/ZapLib",
