  "releaseNotes": "v2.6.0 — Security and execution improvements. Includes:\n        * BREAKING: removed DES reversible encryption methods. Use Crypto.AESEncryption / Crypto.AESDecryption instead.\n        * Security: AES-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 reversible encryption, plus Fetch.ValidPlatform / [ValidPlatform] upgraded from DES to AES authorization.\n        * NEW SQL fire-and-forget execution: QuickExecuteNoWait and QuickExecNoWait run in background with independent SQL connections.\n        * MyLog ForceLog fallback now writes to one .force log file instead of recursive GUID-suffix files.\n      v2.5.0 (previous stable) — OracleSQL, dependency CVE fixes, public method spelling aliases, and DocFX documentation site.\n      v1.23.0 (legacy) — .NET Framework 4.7.2 legacy line.\n\n      Full changelog: https://github.com/LinZap/ZapLib/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
